(134, 'PT. Galaksi Investasi Harapan (GIH)', 'Manufacturing', NULL, '+ 62 778 371 713', 'hr@gih-asia.com', 'https://gih-asia.com', '-', '-', '-', '-', 'https://gih-asia.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/logo-gih-old.png', 'Panbil Industrial Estate, Factory B3 Lot3, Jl. Ahmad Yani, Muka Kuning, Kecamatan Nongsa, Kota Batam', 'KEPULAUAN RIAU', 'KOTA BATAM', '&lt;p&gt;Welcome to PT. Galaksi Investasi Harapan. A subsidiary company of Charu Holdings based in Malaysia, operating out of Batam. With over a decade of experience in the manufacturing industry, GIH has established itself as a reliable and high-quality provider of industrial products. Our strategic location in Batam provides easy access to key markets in Southeast Asia, a robust infrastructure making us a competitive player in the region. We are reputed in the area for using innovative technologies and sustainable practices to ensure our customers receive the best products at competitive prices.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
