(234, 'PT Tristar Marine', 'Engineering', NULL, '+62 811 7776167', 'tristarmarine@gmail.com', 'https://www.tristarmarine.co.id/', 'https://id-id.facebook.com/PtTristarMarine/', '-', '-', 'https://id.linkedin.com/company/tristarmarine', 'TRISTAR MARINE', 'Komplek Taman Niaga Sukajadi Blok B No 11. Sukajadi,Batam Kota, Kepulauan Riau 29444', 'KEPULAUAN RIAU', 'KOTA BATAM', '&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;We here at Tristar Marine strive to respond and fulfill our customer&amp;#39;s needs &amp;amp; expectations, maintaining long-term relationships in the process by offering our clients the highest quality services and the smartest solutions in marine business activities through continuous improvement driven by the integrity, cooperation and expertise of our team.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;\\r\\n&lt;br /&gt;\\r\\nPT. Tristar Marine has become a reputable Marine and Offshore Engineering Solutions Service over the years, both regionally and internationally. Our teams are up for every job, managing projects with the skill and experience our clients have come to expect. We want our customers to be satisfied with our work, which is why we provide open communication channels throughout the duration of each project.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;\\\\r\\\\n&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
(235, 'PT UTAMA GLOBAL ALKES', 'Other', NULL, '081365895441', 'utamaglobalalkes@gmail.com', '-', '-', '-', '-', '-', '-', 'Komp. Mega Legenda 2 Blok B3 No.17 Batam - Kepri', 'KEPULAUAN RIAU', 'KOTA BATAM', '&lt;p&gt;-&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
(236, 'PT VORTEX ENERGY BATAM', 'Engineering', NULL, '0778 4800577', 'sales@pt-vortex.com', 'www.pt-vortex.com', 'Vortex-MES 4.0 Group', '-', 'vortexmes', '-', '-', 'Jl. Kw. Industri Tunas, Belian, Kec. Batam Kota, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau 29444', 'KEPULAUAN RIAU', 'KOTA BATAM', '&lt;p&gt;Vortex &amp;ndash; MES 4.0 was started with PT. Vortex Energy Batam that&amp;nbsp; established in 2010 and has already expended our business by&amp;nbsp; establishing Cikarang unit office PT. Vorteks Teknologi Indonesia in&amp;nbsp; 2012 and PT. MES Teknologi Indonesia in 2021 located at Batam,&amp;nbsp; Kepulauan Riau.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;We specializing in fabricating various types of High Precision Parts, Jig&amp;nbsp; &amp;amp; Fixture, Special Purpose Machine (SPM), Factory Automation&amp;nbsp; Services and SMT industrial solution. Also, we are specializing in&amp;nbsp; engineering, consulting, manufacturing and integration of automated&amp;nbsp; production systems. We provide innovative technological production&amp;nbsp; system and innovate technological solutions to a wide range of&amp;nbsp; customers in the fields of manufacturing and industrial processes with&amp;nbsp; the help of our team of qualified experts in mechanics, electricity,&amp;nbsp; automation, robotics, instrumentation and information systems.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;After years of experience in the field, our talented employees focus their&amp;nbsp; energy on helping businesses meet the challenges of today&amp;rsquo;s new&amp;nbsp; economic realities, such as globalization, competitiveness and ever&amp;nbsp; changing commodity and energy prices.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;\\\\r\\\\n&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
(237, 'PT. Wasco Engineering ', 'Engineering', NULL, '(+65) 6742 1283', ' wasco@singnet.com.sg', 'https://www.wasco.com.sg/', '-', '-', '-', '-', 'https://www.wasco.com.sg/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/logo-wasco.png', 'Jl. Brigjen Katamso No.Km 5, Tj. Uncang, Kec.Batu Aji, Kota Batam', 'KEPULAUAN RIAU', 'KOTA BATAM', '&lt;p&gt;Wasco Engineering Pte Ltd has been in the marine offshore oil and gas industry for more than 28 years. We have accumulated a vast amount of experience in providing and equipping our clients with efficient project management in field of EIT (Electrical, Instrumentation &amp;amp; Telecom).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wasco presently constitutes a workforce that is highly competent, motivated and experienced to successfully accomplish a wide range of major strategic projects involving all types of Marine Structures and Marine-related Platforms both locally and internationally. The establishment of a trail of successful track records may include the Marine FPSO (Floating Production Storage Offloading), Topside Production Modules, Oil Rigs, Living Quarters, Drilling Platforms and more.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our key strength lies in providing our clients in the industry with dynamic and versatile engineering solutions in spite of tight schedules and complex requirements, and consistently achieving quality and timely workmanship with competent management in the overseeing of all phases of our EIT projects for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Additionally, our established network of partners and associates over the years, and range of conformance certified construction equipment allows for a one-stop engineering solution for our clients. Our expertise enables us to provide holistic and uniform solutions to meet our clients&amp;rsquo; requirements for workplace safety, efficiency, and cost effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wasco is certified to OHSAS 18001:2007. We are also recognized for its safety initiatives and efforts, earning the bizSAFE Enterprise Level STAR certification. Wasco ensures occupational health and safety standards as per the requirements of the Ministry of Manpower are met and upheld. To state the affirmation of our progress over the years, we had received numerous Workplace Safety &amp;amp; Health (WSH) awards and recognitions from our valued customers in appreciation of us completing all works promptly and safely.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wasco Engineering Pte Ltd has been committed to completing every project promptly and punctually, with consistent quality assurance, safety of our operations in mind, and integrity in our conduct.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
