(442, 'PT USDA SEROJA JAYA', 'Engineering', NULL, '0778363666', 'usda-pga@usdaseroja.com', 'www.usdaseroja.com', '-', '-', '@usda_serojajaya', 'www.linkedin.com/company/usda-seroja-jaya', '-', 'PT. Usda Seroja Jaya, Jl. Dapur 12, Kel. Sungai Pelunggut, Kec. Sagulung', 'Kepulauan Riau', 'Batam', '<p>PT Usda Seroja Jaya was established in 1985 in Rengat as Shipping and Shipyard Company focusing in liquid cargo transportation. Our vision from the beginning is to be the leading local Shipping and Shipyard Company in Indonesia, and we relentlessly pursuing that goal in this growing market. We strive to lead the market with our experience and expertise in order to stay one step ahead from our competitors.&nbsp;Our competitive advantage is we build and operate our own ships. Therefore we understand exactly what kind of ship, accessories, technical specifications required to run ships carrying certain products effectively and efficiently.</p>\\r\\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
