(1096, 'PT. AWOT GLOBAL LOGISTICS BATAM', 'Logistic', NULL, '0778-411400', 'awotbth@awotglobal.com', 'awotglobal.ac.id', '-', '-', '-', '-', '-', 'Repindo Industrial Park, Jl. Tenggiri No.10 blok A2, Batu Merah, Kec. Batu Ampar, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau 29452', 'Kepulauan Riau', 'Batam', '&lt;p&gt;AWOT Global Corporation is a top-ranking logistics service provider, which offers comprehensive logistics solutions to customers in different business industries all over the world. Our extensive presence in global with 51 self-owned offices, and strong edge in Asia where our Headquarter based, enable us to position AWOT as a unique and competent partner. The global outreach to customers is supported by our offices in North America, as well as over 300 agents worldwide. We commit to be a world-class logistics company, and provide quality services as a long-term business partner whom YOU can rely on.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n', 'Verified', '1', 1, NULL, NULL),
